<div class="admin-page-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">COMMUNICATION</span><h1>Actualités & blog</h1><p>Publiez des articles riches avec image, vidéo et commentaires.</p></div><a class="btn secondary" href="/actualites" target="_blank">Voir le blog ↗</a></div>
<div class="news-admin-grid"><section class="panel news-compose"><div class="panel-heading"><div><h2>Nouvel article</h2><p>Le contenu publié apparaîtra immédiatement sur le site.</p></div></div><form method="post" action="/admin/actualites" enctype="multipart/form-data" class="modern-form" data-news-form><label class="field full"><span>Titre de l’article *</span><input name="title" required maxlength="190" placeholder="Un titre clair et engageant"></label><label class="field full"><span>Résumé</span><textarea name="excerpt" rows="3" maxlength="500" placeholder="Introduction affichée dans la liste des actualités"></textarea></label><label class="field full"><span>Contenu complet *</span><textarea name="content" rows="12" required data-news-content placeholder="Rédigez votre article..."></textarea></label><div class="form-row"><label class="field"><span>Image principale</span><input type="file" name="cover_image" accept="image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp" data-news-cover></label><label class="field"><span>Ou URL d’image</span><input type="url" name="cover_url" placeholder="https://..."></label></div><div class="news-live-preview" data-news-image-preview hidden></div><label class="field full"><span>Vidéo (YouTube, Vimeo ou fichier hébergé)</span><input type="url" name="video_url" placeholder="https://youtube.com/watch?v=..."></label><label class="field"><span>Publication</span><select name="status"><option value="published">Publier maintenant</option><option value="draft">Enregistrer en brouillon</option></select></label><button class="btn primary" type="submit">Publier l’article</button></form></section>
<aside class="panel news-library"><div class="panel-heading"><div><h2>Articles</h2><p><?= count($posts) ?> contenu<?= count($posts)>1?'s':'' ?></p></div></div><?php if(!$posts): ?><div class="empty-mini"><span>✎</span><p>Aucun article. Créez votre première actualité.</p></div><?php else: ?><div class="admin-post-list"><?php foreach($posts as $post): ?><article><?php if($post['cover_image']): ?><img src="<?= htmlspecialchars($post['cover_image']) ?>" alt=""><?php else: ?><div class="post-placeholder">IF</div><?php endif ?><div><span class="status-dot <?= $post['status']==='published'?'published':'draft' ?>"><?= $post['status']==='published'?'Publié':'Brouillon' ?></span><h3><?= htmlspecialchars($post['title']) ?></h3><small><?= (int)$post['comment_count'] ?> commentaire(s) · <?= date('d/m/Y',strtotime($post['created_at'])) ?></small><?php if($post['status']==='published'): ?><a href="/actualites/<?= urlencode($post['slug']) ?>" target="_blank">Ouvrir l’article ↗</a><?php endif ?></div></article><?php endforeach ?></div><?php endif ?></aside></div>
<style>.news-admin-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.35fr) minmax(300px,.65fr);gap:18px}.news-compose,.news-library{padding:22px}.news-live-preview{height:220px;border-radius:16px;background-size:cover;background-position:center}.admin-post-list{display:grid;gap:13px}.admin-post-list article{display:grid;grid-template-columns:76px 1fr;gap:12px;padding:12px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:13px}.admin-post-list img,.post-placeholder{width:76px;height:70px;object-fit:cover;border-radius:9px}.post-placeholder{display:grid;place-items:center;background:#edf1ef;color:var(--primary);font-weight:900}.admin-post-list h3{font-size:13px;margin:6px 0}.admin-post-list small,.admin-post-list a{display:block;font-size:9px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:5px}.status-dot{font-size:8px;font-weight:800;color:#9a6d00}.status-dot.published{color:#168257}@media(max-width:1000px){.news-admin-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}</style>
